'''Kali''' (Japanese: '''キリカ''' ''Kirika'') is a {{tc|Furisode Girl}} from the [[Laverre Gym]]. In {{aniseries|PTS}}, she is a recurring character who first appeared in ''[[XY073|A Fashionable Battle!]]''.

==In animation==
===''Pokémon the Series''===
===={{aniseries|XY}}====
Kali is a {{tc|Furisode Girl}} loyal to [[Laverre City]] [[Gym Leader]] [[Valerie]]. She was first shown ordering other Furisode Girls around in preparation for a fashion show showcasing Valerie's fashion collection. She later appeared as one of the announcers of the fashion show and refereed a [[Gym]] {{pkmn|battle}} between Valerie and [[Sawyer]] that was part of the fashion show.

Kali reappeared in ''[[XY074|Fairy-Type Trickery!]]'', acting as the [[Battle judge|referee]] of {{Ash}} and Valerie's Gym battle.

She reappeared in a flashback in ''[[XY140|Till We Compete Again!]]''.

